      "category": "feature_construction",
      "rationale": "Test a mild causal prefix-length feature across all four datasets: amplify real history inputs by up to 3% as observed context grows. Padding remains zero and candidate embeddings remain unchanged. The embedded predictor imports the modified model; matching metadata validation ensures consistent inference without changing learned embeddings, GRU topology, readout, loss, or optimizer.",
